{"task_id": "HumanEval/49", "solution": "def modp(n: int, p: int):\n    \"\"\"Return 2^n modulo p (be aware of numerics).\n    This function computes 2^n mod p using binary exponentiation (square-and-multiply algorithm).\n    \"\"\"\n    result = 1\n    base_val = 2 % p\n    exponent = n\n\n    while exponent > 0:\n        if exponent % 2 == 1:  # If exponent is odd\n            result = (result * base_val) % p\n        base_val = (base_val * base_val) % p\n        exponent //= 2\n    return result"}
