{"task_id": "HumanEval/52", "solution": "def below_threshold(l: list, t: int):\n    \"\"\"Return True if all numbers in the list l are below threshold t.\n    >>> below_threshold([1, 2, 4, 10], 100)\n    True\n    >>> below_threshold([1, 20, 4, 10], 5)\n    False\n    \"\"\"\n    class Threshold:\n        def __init__(self, value: int):\n            self.value = value\n\n    class NumberList:\n        def __init__(self, numbers: list):\n            self.numbers = numbers\n\n        def belowThreshold(self, threshold_value: int) -> bool:\n            for num in self.numbers:\n                if num >= threshold_value:\n                    return False\n            return True\n\n    number_list_obj = NumberList(l)\n    threshold_obj = Threshold(t)\n    return number_list_obj.belowThreshold(threshold_obj.value)"}
